WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:31.980
Hannibal of the Buff Clan and Marshall of the Earth's Scarabelli joined
forces to pursue the Ideon.

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:37.800
They intended to drop the Night Star's satellite onto the Ideon and Solo Ship.

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:41.700
What?!

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:43.160
Meteorites!

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:44.200
It's the stardust!

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:53.890
But the light of the Ideon was
able to suppress the impact.

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:57.090
Having seen this power, Marshall
was at a loss for words.

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:01.200
A demon ship?!

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:07.200
<b>Goodbye, Solo Ship</b>

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:15.280
We already have thirty survivors on our Clop!

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:17.940
There's no way we could carry
over a hundred people more!

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:19.680
Use it like a cargo ship.

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:22.820
If you put people in the combat blocks, there's room for five or six hundred.

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:24.420
Or do you have better suggestions?

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:28.120
You came to steal the Solo Ship, so you want to stick around?

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:29.830
Don't be absurd!

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:33.000
Why would we want to stay on this cursed ship?

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:35.240
Then do as we say.

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:38.450
If you return to Earth, you'll be
 sentenced to death! You hear me?

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:40.520
How's it going?

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:41.350
Everything's fine!

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.330
I can't take this anymore!

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:50.680
I can't live like this!

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:52.970
I'm going home!

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:54.660
Home!

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:57.160
Hey, what's wrong?

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:58.110
I'm going home!

00:02:58.520 --> 00:02:59.740
I'm going home!

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:04.100
Aren't you a man? Haven't you
been fighting up until today?

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:05.090
Get a grip!

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:07.810
If you want to go home,
you have to create it yourself!

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:09.580
Stay tough like a man!

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:11.800
Now's not the time to give up hope!

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:13.960
How is he?

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:16.130
Not too well. Let's go!

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:22.820
If we stay on this ship, we're
 doomed no matter where we go!

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:30.560
The darkness of space is infinite...

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:49.140
What about the food?

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:50.290
It's been loaded!

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:51.750
Hurry up, please!

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:53.860
We don't know how long the air in here will last.

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:56.130
This is for the best.

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:57.540
For the sake of our survival...

00:03:58.040 --> 00:03:59.210
Hatari, can you pilot this?

00:03:59.320 --> 00:03:59.840
Yeah!

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:02.900
This model is newer than the Carioca, it's easy to use.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:04.540
Get the supplies loaded fast.

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:09.500
We don't know how many months
we'll be aboard this small ship.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.240
Are they really going to abandon it?

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:26.490
The Solo Ship can't be controlled by mere humans.

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:29.570
If that's how it is, they must be serious.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:32.580
But...

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:35.950
Military orders aren't always infallible, Miraclin.

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:36.600
Yes.

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:37.730
Let's meet with them.

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:41.910
We'll see if they really are planning
to blow up the Solo Ship.

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:51.110
It's not surprising they would want to
 leave a ship possessed by the devil...

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:55.590
You're setting explosives inside of the ship?

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.020
This ship endured even your attack.

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:00.650
This is the only way to destroy it.

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:02.190
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:02.690
Sure.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.490
The research on Ide is still incomplete.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:06.660
Let us bring it back to Earth.

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:11.490
The power that destroyed Night Star
was not under our control.

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:16.160
It's like a baby waving around a knife,
you'd better not mess with it.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:17.800
It could spell the end of humanity.

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:19.420
What'd you say?!

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:22.710
Stop it. He speaks the truth.

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:25.160
But what about your warrant for treason?

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:27.200
We're going to find a new planet to live on.

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:28.720
Sounds good.

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:32.660
We'll report that the Clop was sunk by the Buff Clan.

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:34.440
Thank you very much.

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:37.960
However, we're taking the Clop's crew with us.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:40.260
They aren't as far-sighted as you are.

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:41.110
Yes.

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:42.400
Sir!

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:44.310
Silence, Miraclin.

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:47.800
He's the commander of the Scarabelli?

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:48.360
Yeah.

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:50.260
They withdrew quite easily...

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:01.030
Sir Galbaba...

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.150
Do you want to watch?

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:04.470
Certainly, if it's Lady Miya dancing...

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:07.540
Alright, display it on the monitor! Let them see Miya!

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:19.990
Are you getting married after this operation is over?

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:23.360
Yes. It's impossible to get tired of watching her.

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:24.400
Right?

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:25.320
Yes.

00:06:26.040 --> 00:06:28.900
Our advance team will exceed
everyone's expectations.

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:30.780
That'll be my wedding present!

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:35.380
We're against only one
 Heavy Mobile Mecha-level unit!

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:11.490
You were close to getting a
 doctor's degree back there.

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:13.990
Good work.

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:16.610
Bes, we'd better pay attention to the Scarabelli.

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:18.790
We're observing them.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:20.710
Speak of the devil, they're moving out!

00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:22.920
They're approaching the Solo Ship!

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:23.960
What should we do?

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:25.000
Don't let them get near!

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:26.000
We've got to stop them!

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:36.220
That Marshall guy was only trying to trick us!

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:40.130
Even if they reach the Solo Ship, they won't be able to remove all those bombs!

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:45.440
Turret 1, this is Cosmo!

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:46.690
Bridge, do you read me?

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:49.150
Okay! If you see anything approaching the Solo Ship, shoot it down!

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:54.160
Turret 2, standing by!

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:57.660
Turret 4, standing by!

00:07:58.480 --> 00:08:03.620
While the Puffers surround the Solo Ship, the search party will remove the bombs!

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:05.170
Act fast!

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:06.630
Puffers, launch!

00:08:16.310 --> 00:08:17.720
There are 120 points in total!

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:20.720
Make sure you memorize your own post!

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:25.200
We only have to remove six of them each. No need to panic!

00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:32.030
All turrets, fire warning shots!
You don't have to hit them!

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:33.350
Roger!

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:40.260
Those Solo Ship bastards!

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:42.790
If that's how you act, we'll just sneak in!

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:47.830
The Solo Ship will shield us! Let's go!

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:58.450
They're too far away, we can't stop them!

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:00.870
We have to get the Clop closer to them!

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:03.220
Bes, can you hear us? Move the Clop!

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:04.060
Wait!

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:06.310
There's no doubt, something is about to DS Out!

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:07.230
The Buff Clan?

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:10.430
Cosmo, something came out
 of DS Drive at one o'clock.

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:12.220
At a time like this?

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:24.910
We've found it! The Logo Dau Aliens' ship!

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:25.910
Attack!

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:45.140
Are you certain this isn't a trap set by the Logo Dau aliens?

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:46.500
Why do you think that?

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:50.680
The gravitational vibrations from that ship were sent on purpose.

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:53.400
There's actually more than one ship.

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:58.390
Despite that, we still have more resources.

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:00.820
We'll attack them with everything we've got.

00:10:01.970 --> 00:10:03.380
Send the Ganga Lubu Ribs too!

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:05.350
It's an all-out battle!

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:19.760
Their numbers?

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:22.530
Seven ships! Number of fighters unknown.

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:24.890
Launching the Puffers and Quartets!

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:26.600
Good, don't let a single unit escape!

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:29.110
What about the squad at the Solo Ship?

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:31.720
After the search party has landed,
have them face the Buff Clan!

00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:42.210
Even if they are Buff Clan, they're
 different from Hannibal! Stay sharp!

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:45.380
Damned Solo Ship! Why couldn't
they just hand it over to us?

00:10:56.960 --> 00:11:00.980
A single shot is enough to blow up this cruiser! What do we do?

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:04.070
Their search party has reached the Solo Ship!

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:06.760
But the bombs will go off in five minutes.

00:11:07.010 --> 00:11:08.840
We might not be able to make it back.

00:11:09.010 --> 00:11:11.090
Bes! We've got to return to the Solo Ship!

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:13.610
We won't be able to survive here!

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:17.680
Yeah! If the Scarabelli operatives
 have disarmed the bombs,

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:19.740
it's only a fortunate accident!

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:21.830
The fighters are getting close!

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:23.780
Hatari! Take the Clop to the Solo Ship!

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:27.800
What are you doing?

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:29.560
We're returning to the Solo Ship!

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:34.900
All personnel! Once we return to Solo Ship, help deactivate the bombs immediately!

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:36.200
Then launch the Ideon!

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:20.710
They're on the deck too, right?

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:23.590
Their party has gone inside. Well then...

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:28.260
Joliver! Are the timer types easy to recognize?

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:30.930
There aren't any more than three
varieties. You'll know them.

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:38.400
The timer hasn't been stopped!

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:44.160
6 o'clock! There are 60 of them!

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:45.910
Clop, ascending!

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:53.170
Alright, well done!

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:55.780
There's people below you!

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:56.920
Head to the Ideon, quickly!

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:04.020
Over here!

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:06.400
Vent, check on the outside again!

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:08.600
Alright, we'll split up and search!

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:10.420
Are you done with the engine room?

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:11.590
I wasn't told to go!

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:14.310
What?! That's where most of the bombs are!

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:16.390
This is so old fashioned!

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:19.060
There's about twelve of them here.

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:22.840
Aren't you from the Solo Ship crew? What are you doing here?

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:25.170
Remove the timers, you can complain later.

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:31.660
This type... Three to minus two.

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:35.910
Formula 69. Return YR back to zero...

00:13:38.820 --> 00:13:39.540
All right!

00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:43.630
Return R-2 to zero.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:45.510
Why'd you have to do this?

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:47.840
There's still eight left! Talk later!

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:51.680
The battle squad has reached the enemy!

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:55.090
First and second squads,
destroy the enemy's flagship!

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:00.510
Main ship, seize the Logo Dau Ship!

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:06.240
Prepare for ship-to-ship combat, they're coming from below!

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:27.340
The gauge is on!

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:27.970
Roger!

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:30.870
Gije! Kasha! Did you manage to stop the timers?

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:33.180
Only two more! Go ahead!

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:34.760
Okay, let's go!

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:41.010
It's that big one!

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:46.360
Damn it!

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:51.070
It stopped? Kasha, what about you?

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:53.490
Gije! Stop it!

00:14:57.860 --> 00:14:58.910
Too late?!

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:00.670
I'm sorry!

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:02.420
Time's up!

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:03.920
I'm too late!

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:09.010
There's four left! Someone, stop that timer!

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:10.610
There!

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:12.260
There's still more!

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:13.580
It's on the left!

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:17.600
It's time...

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:54.390
The time's up... Those operators did it!

00:15:54.610 --> 00:15:56.220
The explosives have been all stopped!

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:04.420
Cosmo! Did they manage to stop the bombs?

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:07.230
Gije! Kasha! Can you hear me? How'd it go?

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.480
I don't know!

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:10.000
You stopped the timer, right?

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:13.760
No, we couldn't stop it. But the explosion...

00:16:14.130 --> 00:16:15.070
The barrier...

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:17.690
The explosion was sealed in.

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:20.150
They were sealed in?

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:29.080
The explosion...

00:16:30.640 --> 00:16:31.380
Karala?!

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:34.370
They exploded!

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:37.010
But... We didn't die...

00:16:38.340 --> 00:16:39.760
We didn't die...

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:46.650
The explosion was sealed in? The
self-defense instinct of the Ide...

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:48.360
Self-defense instinct?

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:53.070
Cosmo! They're breaking through our defense line!

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:57.240
Here they come!

00:17:04.470 --> 00:17:08.030
The energy hasn't risen yet, but should
we try the Ideon Swords, Cosmo?

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:09.420
The Swords?

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:11.370
Sure, turn the circuits!

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:12.340
Roger!

00:17:16.230 --> 00:17:17.940
Okay, come on...

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:20.760
Go!

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:25.390
Did we hit them?

00:17:25.570 --> 00:17:26.770
One unit down!

00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:43.870
Don't let the Buff Clan have the Solo Ship! Otherwise, we will...

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:49.210
The Scarabelli has been sunk!

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:50.540
Get us underneath the Solo Ship!

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:54.020
Roger. What happened on the Solo Ship, Bes?

00:17:54.230 --> 00:17:57.760
The timers were all stopped! We only need to take down the Buff Clan fleet!

00:18:01.570 --> 00:18:04.890
Excellent! All that remains
is the Logo Dau aliens' ship!

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:07.060
Concentrate all fire power on it!

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:07.640
Yes!

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:09.480
Watch this, Miya!

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:12.120
Here's my present for you!

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:16.150
All hands, anti-air fire!

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:17.440
Joliver!

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:19.720
Release the Ideon Wave Leader Gun!

00:18:22.050 --> 00:18:25.370
All operators, defend us with
 nearby missiles and turrets!

00:18:26.210 --> 00:18:27.870
I'm opening the Wave Leader Gun's hatch.

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:29.520
Alright, where's the Ideon?

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:37.800
Cosmo! We've releasing the
 Wave Leader Gun! Take it!

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:39.090
Can we use it?

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:42.070
It should be alright. There's seven enemy warships!

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:42.930
Okay!

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:57.320
The power is on!

00:18:57.320 --> 00:18:57.880
Great!

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:01.040
Deck! We'll destroy that fleet with one shot!

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:03.170
Roger! Move the targeting reticle up!

00:19:03.590 --> 00:19:05.520
Roger! Well spotted!

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:06.790
It's all about skill!

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:22.180
Let's go!

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:29.560
We've got them! Solo Ship, enter a short DS Drive!

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:31.510
Ideon Gun, ready to fire!

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:41.360
Too late! Soon you'll have no place to return to!

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:54.960
They went into subspace?

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:21.100
Galbaba's fleet is gone!

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:24.020
They've been destroyed.
Destroyed in the blink of an eye!

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:27.400
Send a distress signal! Activate the biosensors!

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:35.380
Gije, Kasha! We're coming back.

00:20:35.990 --> 00:20:37.160
To the Solo Ship?

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:38.340
Is something wrong?

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:40.300
It's not that, but...

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:43.170
It's not that, but...

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:45.480
You don't really want to return either.

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:52.500
The Ide has taken hold of us all.

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:00.150
Thank you.

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:03.430
We can't even commit suicide.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:07.840
If we tried to kill ourselves, the Ide
 would stop us. This isn't just dumb luck.

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:11.650
I think the Solo Ship called the Buff Clan here.

00:21:11.650 --> 00:21:14.820
To force us back to the Solo Ship.

00:21:14.820 --> 00:21:18.000
Yes, it was the Ide's plan.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:22.630
So the already Ide possesses its own will, like us?

00:21:22.930 --> 00:21:24.500
What will we do in that case?

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:29.930
Even if we show good intentions to the
awakened Ide, it won't respond.

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:39.410
Probably... But if the Ide called
us back, then maybe it needs us.

00:21:40.260 --> 00:21:41.520
I'd like to think so.

00:21:42.210 --> 00:21:45.620
Perhaps the Ide was awakened by our good spirits.

00:21:46.480 --> 00:21:47.620
That's probably it.

00:21:48.210 --> 00:21:51.410
If it wasn't, then we wouldn't
 have been called back.

00:21:52.280 --> 00:21:53.740
Think about it.

00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:58.580
If the Ide really wanted to prolong the battle and finally wipe out us all...

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:00.920
We wouldn't be considered worthy.

00:22:01.490 --> 00:22:03.880
Yeah. Nobody wants to be wiped out.

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:08.480
The Ide doesn't want that either, which is why it called us back.

00:22:21.150 --> 00:22:25.810
Harulu was shocked to hear that Galbaba's forces had been destroyed.

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:30.520
The Buff Clan's advance force had been
sunk within a blink of an eye.

00:22:31.440 --> 00:22:36.850
The Buff Clan had no choice but to gamble
its fate on the destruction of the Ideon.

00:22:50.760 --> 00:22:54.680
<i>Colony planet Ajian makes a secret
 arrangement with the Buff Clan.</i>

00:22:55.220 --> 00:22:59.350
<i>When the Solo Ship lands there, the children
are taken hostage.</i>

00:22:59.750 --> 00:23:03.060
<i>Sheryl's sister Lin is shot.</i>

00:23:03.410 --> 00:23:05.780
<i>As if it could understand the sorrow,</i>

00:23:05.980 --> 00:23:09.380
<i>the Ide's power increases and
scorches the heavens.</i>

00:23:10.150 --> 00:23:15.120
<i>Next time, on Legendary Giant
 Ideon: "Colony of Hatred"</i>

00:23:13.180 --> 00:23:17.730
<b>Next Episode</b>

